Upstream: Google RE2
Release: 2022-06-01
Source: https://github.com/google/re2/archive/refs/tags/2022-06-01.tar.gz
License: BSD-3-Clause (see LICENSE)

This directory contains the upstream headers plus the minimal source set named
by that release's CMakeLists.txt RE2_SOURCES target. Tests, benchmarks, build
systems, generated-data scripts, and PCRE adapters are omitted. The generated
perl_groups.cc, unicode_casefold.cc, and unicode_groups.cc files are retained.
